flowchart TD
    I[Initial puzzle state] --> C[Apply deterministic exit closure]
    C --> W{Complete?}
    W -->|Yes| F[SOLVABLE: fast path, 0 rotates]
    W -->|No| R{Rotate charges remain?}
    R -->|No| U[UNSOLVABLE]
    R -->|Yes| Q[Lexicographic Dijkstra over closed states]
    Q --> X[Generate sorted legal rotates]
    X --> T[Apply rotate via domain engine]
    T --> C2[Apply exit closure]
    C2 --> D{Dominated state?}
    D -->|Yes| P[Prune]
    D -->|No| E[Enqueue by rotate count, action count, state key]
    E --> B{Budget exceeded?}
    B -->|Yes| N[INCONCLUSIVE]
    B -->|No| Q
